  Release Notes for 0.8.0

 o FEATURE: Paper summaries are rendered properly. A summary is
            written in Markdown, and until now it was shown through a
            handful of regular expressions that knew bold, italic,
            code and little else, so nested lists, quotations, tables
            and code blocks were not correctly interpetted. They are
            now parsed as CommonMark.

 o FEATURE: The OpenAlex API key can be set in Preferences.

 o FEATURE: Help -> Show Log. Alexandria now writes everything it
            prints to a log file as well as to the terminal, and
            shows it in a window with a Copy button. This should
            make bug reports easier to make.

 o CHANGE:  The status bar names the file it is talking about instead
            of "Library updated (deleted)".

