            tell whether two events were a second apart or an hour.

 o BUG-FIX: Papers whose files have been moved or deleted no longer
            cost a network lookup on every launch. Alexandria
            deliberately keeps the index entry, in case the file is
            on a drive that has not been mounted yet (for example).

